    "summary": "The §7.3 node agreement-prekey certificate through the §7.6 cross-signature reconstruction, and the §7.4 client agreement-prekey certificate through §8.6 step 5: valid transcripts and signatures, both sides of each `E2EE_MAX_CLOCK_SKEW` edge, the `E2EE_PREKEY_LIFETIME` bound, namespace mismatches, usage-field substitution, and the strict-decode failures of §3.6. The maximum-namespace certificates additionally discharge §3.2.1 S9.",
